 "name": "switch2",
 "notes": "Learned on hardware 2026-11-14 (System Settings list opens on Airplane Mode; HOME bottom row starts at Nintendo Switch Online; LEFT on the first game tile wraps to Show More). HOME on the HOME menu returns to the running software, so routes start with {\"ensure\": \"home\"}. The screen dims after inactivity and the first press only wakes it, so routes start with B (no-op on HOME). DOWN from a game tile lands on the icon below that tile, so routes find icons by their label.",
